      "created_at": "2026-01-16T01:51:38.976Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Howdy all! ERPNext/frappe-world newbie here <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I’ve tried many variations, but I have yet to succeed in deploying ERPNext v16 via easy-install.py. I have succeeded in deploying v15, so I know that I’ve got the proper pieces in place.</p>\n<p>I have tried using frappe_docker, also unsuccessfully.</p>\n<p>Does anyone have an example command line(s) for easy-install or frappe_docker that produces a running v16 production environment?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
